        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Suppression &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Null Weight</p><p><em>Heavy, dull, and magic stops working properly in the room. This is the anti-magic Substrate.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>+1 circumstance bonus to saves against magic. Divinations of 3rd rank or lower cannot locate you.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Once per round, when a Mutation damages a creature, it takes <strong>&minus;1 status to its next save</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Creatures within 10 feet take <strong>&minus;1 status to spell attack rolls and spell DCs</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Once per encounter, as a two-action activity, <strong>suppress magical effects in a 15-foot emanation for 1 round</strong> (counteract each; rank = half your level).</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. The whole Mutation switches off at Depth 3+ while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
